# Client data never belongs in this repository.
#
# The site is served by GitHub Pages from the repository root, and the repo
# is public — anything committed here is published twice over: once on the
# website and once through GitHub itself. Registers built from the Salesforce
# export (data/build-vehicle-register.py) are for importing into the PRIVATE
# Claims TT Google Sheet only.
data/*.csv
data/*.json

node_modules/
__pycache__/

# Worktrees the Claude Code harness creates for parallel build agents. Live
# scaffolding, never source: committing one would bring a second copy of the
# repository into the repository.
.claude/worktrees/

# Film build artefacts. The narration, the beds, the capture and the mix are
# all reproducible from tools/film/*-lines.json and *-timing.json, and they
# run to tens of megabytes each. The repository keeps the recipe, not the
# intermediate products — the MP4 and its poster are committed because the
# site serves them.
tools/film/vo*/
tools/film/cap*/
tools/film/_track.wav
tools/film/bed-*.wav
tools/film/sfx-*.wav
tools/film/*-mix.wav
tools/film/captions-*.ass
# A three-scene preview of the meeting film, built to agree the graphics
# before the other 22 are drawn. The served film pages (board-*.html) are
# tracked; this one is a build artifact and rebuilds from mtg3-lines.json,
# mtg3-timing.json and build-boardfilm.py.
orphan-transition/mtg3.html
orphan-transition/mtg3-poster.jpg
tools/film/mtg3.mp4
tools/film/vomtg3/
orphan-transition/mtgfull.html
orphan-transition/mtgfull-poster.jpg
tools/film/mtgfull.mp4
tools/film/vomtgfull/

# The four day films, one per role (17 October 2026). Same rule as above:
# the SOURCE is tracked — <key>-lines.json, <key>-timing.json and the four
# scene functions in build-boardfilm.py — and the rendered page, the poster,
# the MP4 and the narration are build artifacts that rebuild from it.
orphan-transition/day-advisor.html
orphan-transition/day-sales-support.html
orphan-transition/day-unit-manager.html
orphan-transition/day-branch-manager.html
orphan-transition/day-*.jpg
tools/film/day*.mp4
tools/film/vodaystaff/
tools/film/vodayagent/
tools/film/vodayunit/
tools/film/vodaybm/
tools/film/cap-day*/
tools/film/bed-day*.wav
tools/film/sfx-day*.wav
tools/film/day*-mix.wav
tools/film/captions-day*.ass
# The music the manager sent on 17 October. tools/film/audio/ is published
# on the branch site, so a track only goes in there once its licence is
# known and written into ATTRIBUTION.md — the uncleared-music exposure in
# PR #190 is exactly this mistake, already live. Held out until then.
tools/film/audio/music-motivation.m4a

# the transition send: the departed agents' names and every client file stay out
tools/letters/departed.txt
tools/letters/exclude.txt
tools/letters/*.csv
